0035:     - Extract the normalized mask of the colored template inside the grey
0036:       L-frame bbox.
0037:     - Find the unique outside object with the same normalized mask, ignoring
0038:       its color.
0039:     - Recolor that matched outside object to grey and leave all other pixels
0040:       unchanged.
